    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7454" root="حذق" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَاقِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Sharpened:</i> applied to a knife: (Ibn-
'Abbád, K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذْلَاقٌ</span></b>  signifies the same,
applied to a thing [of any kind]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاذِقٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  (tropical:)  A man <i>chaste,</i> or <i>eloquent, of
tongue;</i> (S, K, * TA;) <i>perspicuous in language.</i>
(S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A young ass;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجْشٌ</span>. (K.)

